  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This is the example where we want a method to take a ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "set of datastreams as input. We want there to be a ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "single datastreams binding key for the set such ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "as \"PHOTOS\" and then a list of image/gifs can be ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "associated with this key. Right now we can associate a ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "single datastream ID with a binding key.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-03-24 13:56",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "We need to rationalize this in terms of the new ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "structoid/contentModel stuff.  Either accomodate it there ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "or get rid of it as a requirement.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
