  "description": "<p>This is the example where we want a method to take a <br/>\nset of datastreams as input. We want there to be a <br/>\nsingle datastreams binding key for the set such <br/>\nas \"PHOTOS\" and then a list of image/gifs can be <br/>\nassociated with this key. Right now we can associate a <br/>\nsingle datastream ID with a binding key.<br/>\nDate: 2005-03-24 13:56<br/>\nSender: payette<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=128<br/>\nWe need to rationalize this in terms of the new <br/>\nstructoid/contentModel stuff.  Either accomodate it there <br/>\nor get rid of it as a requirement.</p>",
